{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23721","headline":"送敏中归豳宁幕 · 白居易","name":"送敏中归豳宁幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六十衰翁儿女悲，傍人应笑尔应知。\n弟兄垂老相逢日，桮酒临欢欲散时。\n前路加餐须努力，今宵尽醉莫推辞。\n司徒知我难爲别，直过秋归未讶迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}